sequenceDiagram

participant Client
participant BusinessService
participant SolverAdapter
participant Solver
participant Engine

Client->>BusinessService: Optimize Route

BusinessService->>SolverAdapter: optimize(request)

SolverAdapter->>Solver: delegate(request)

Solver->>Engine: execute()

Engine-->>Solver: result

Solver-->>SolverAdapter: OptimizationResult

SolverAdapter-->>BusinessService: OptimizationResult

BusinessService-->>Client: Response